{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Digital Image Forensics.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Digital Image Forensics.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"digital image forensics digital image forensics","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Digital Image Forensics.md","fileName":"Digital Image Forensics.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Digital Image Forensics","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-16 00:47\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Image Authenticity and Forensic Reasoning]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Image Authenticity and Forensic Reasoning","Image Metadata","JPEG Compression","fakephotos.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Digital Image Forensics.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Digital Image Forensics.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"digital image forensics digital image forensics","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Digital Image Forensics.md","fileName":"Digital Image Forensics.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Digital Image Forensics","heading":"Digital Image Forensics","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Digital image forensics examines a photograph for evidence that its recorded history or visible content has been altered. It does not require a watermark or a signature embedded at capture; instead, it models the physical and computational stages that produced the image and tests whether their expected traces remain mutually consistent.\n\nThose traces can occur in [[Image Metadata]], scene lighting and geometry, pixel statistics, camera-sensor artifacts, or [[JPEG Compression]]. Because each test rests on assumptions and has failure modes, a forensic conclusion should describe the particular evidence found rather than claim certainty from one detector.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Image Authenticity and Forensic Reasoning","Image Metadata","JPEG Compression","fakephotos.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Digital Image Forensics.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Digital Image Forensics.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"digital image forensics digital image forensics","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Digital Image Forensics.md","fileName":"Digital Image Forensics.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Digital Image Forensics","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[fakephotos.epub]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Image Authenticity and Forensic Reasoning","Image Metadata","JPEG Compression","fakephotos.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}